{
  "book": "lyj",
  "volumes": [
    {
      "volume": 1,
      "url": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%A5%9E%E5%9A%B4%E7%B6%93/%E5%8D%B701",
      "permalink": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=%E6%A5%9E%E5%9A%B4%E7%B6%93/%E5%8D%B701&oldid=831984",
      "sourceSha256": "f69a2bbaa5bf7ee65ae2f0b90d6d0cd56fa420ae2a943892d95aacc28248c798",
      "textSha256": "6444bbaee031099668d94949a56a8969f637f5808cc78cb0fe1f789786e53fad",
      "paragraphs": 17,
      "charactersWithPunctuation": 6281,
      "start": "如是我聞，一時，佛在室羅筏城，祇桓精舍。與大比丘眾，千二百五十人",
      "end": "自開合，見無舒卷。云何汝今，以動為身？以動為境？從始洎終，念念生滅？遺失真性，顛倒行事，性心失真，認物為己，輪回是中，自取流轉。"
    },
    {
      "volume": 2,
      "url": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%A5%9E%E5%9A%B4%E7%B6%93/%E5%8D%B702",
      "permalink": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=%E6%A5%9E%E5%9A%B4%E7%B6%93/%E5%8D%B702&oldid=1168973",
      "sourceSha256": "1b13cc820cb868088c9722eae655e014a7bd390bebbbc7218fe745a9898144f0",
      "textSha256": "619376718803c8d76ff5f4076a599de1632e186e005762a685b0c9c7e2dec69a",
      "paragraphs": 67,
      "charactersWithPunctuation": 8037,
      "start": "爾時阿難。及諸大眾。聞佛示誨。身心泰然。念無始來。失卻本心。妄認",
      "end": "。阿難。若彼方來。則本瓶中。既貯空去。於本瓶地。應少虛空。若此方入。開孔倒瓶。應見空出。是故當知。識陰虛妄。本非因緣。非自然性。"
    },
    {
      "volume": 3,
      "url": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%A5%9E%E5%9A%B4%E7%B6%93/%E5%8D%B703",
      "permalink": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=%E6%A5%9E%E5%9A%B4%E7%B6%93/%E5%8D%B703&oldid=2709736",
      "sourceSha256": "daac5e89793e0bb8648417a4b344eb7d227bd845e06e7ebfe90132af5b5994af",
      "textSha256": "52d4dfc528a611d83871e70a444d87cca8af77bac21f38b3a5b189115a4bf4f3",
      "paragraphs": 118,
      "charactersWithPunctuation": 8193,
      "start": "復次。阿難。云何六入。本如來藏妙真如性。阿難。即彼目精瞪發勞者。",
      "end": "世誓先入如一眾生未成佛。終不於此取泥洹大雄大力大慈悲。希更審除微細惑令我早登無上覺。於十方界坐道場舜若多性可銷亡。鑠迦羅心無動轉"
    },
    {
      "volume": 4,
      "url": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%A5%9E%E5%9A%B4%E7%B6%93/%E5%8D%B704",
      "permalink": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=%E6%A5%9E%E5%9A%B4%E7%B6%93/%E5%8D%B704&oldid=163300",
      "sourceSha256": "c46ea705f3ab0078df93ff87da3d3111b57d6e64bfba83152116f33f1da3789e",
      "textSha256": "3140289adae19086b17dc640aa99e2eb4640754ce52b5d233c860510c134ed4c",
      "paragraphs": 246,
      "charactersWithPunctuation": 8508,
      "start": "爾時富樓那彌多羅尼子。在大眾中。即從座起。偏袒右肩。右膝著地。合",
      "end": "染流轉。若棄生滅。守於真常。常光現前。塵根識心。應時銷落。想相為塵。識情為垢。二俱遠離。則汝法眼。應時清明。雲何不成。無上知覺。"
    },
    {
      "volume": 5,
      "url": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%A5%9E%E5%9A%B4%E7%B6%93/%E5%8D%B705",
      "permalink": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=%E6%A5%9E%E5%9A%B4%E7%B6%93/%E5%8D%B705&oldid=2569007",
      "sourceSha256": "f120ee61de77936235e08945dca895118f0ef37f5c472387105ac5de68e09afa",
      "textSha256": "f46a66cd994fc48d803e3fd4aa9498f1e99fa53eacb0600dcacbd25b3cb8cf7e",
      "paragraphs": 170,
      "charactersWithPunctuation": 6556,
      "start": "阿難白佛言。世尊。如來雖說。第二義門。今觀世間。解結之人。若不知",
      "end": "光莊嚴。我本因地。以念佛心。入無生忍。今於此界。攝念佛人。歸於凈土。佛問圓通。我無選擇。都攝六根。凈念相繼。得三摩地。斯為第一。"
    },
    {
      "volume": 6,
      "url": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%A5%9E%E5%9A%B4%E7%B6%93/%E5%8D%B706",
      "permalink": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=%E6%A5%9E%E5%9A%B4%E7%B6%93/%E5%8D%B706&oldid=2599583",
      "sourceSha256": "46dc1ada2ddb22dae4a37b05c8146f94c235fd1a1a0262924a33413c7d8cc264",
      "textSha256": "f41c686f20b598c01f80ee24513fa35a18e96b7e82ea91f0d982dba761d00f3d",
      "paragraphs": 216,
      "charactersWithPunctuation": 6926,
      "start": "爾時觀世音菩薩，即從座起，頂禮佛足，而白佛言：世尊憶念。我昔無數",
      "end": "誰成就。若諸比丘。心如直弦。一切真實。入三摩提。永無魔事。我印是人。成就菩薩。無上知覺。如我是說。名為佛說。不如此說。即波旬說。"
    },
    {
      "volume": 7,
      "url": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%A5%9E%E5%9A%B4%E7%B6%93/%E5%8D%B707",
      "permalink": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=%E6%A5%9E%E5%9A%B4%E7%B6%93/%E5%8D%B707&oldid=1568032",
      "sourceSha256": "fe28f0899099704c7ade1eff4f39e77e3adc34494ec236cb38e66a3bc1c1f838",
      "textSha256": "2b0d68b9a6eb6ab586ca45f4f4ca1ea064b99978170beee641ab824540c05fb3",
      "paragraphs": 144,
      "charactersWithPunctuation": 13481,
      "start": "阿難。汝問攝心。我今先說。入三摩地。修學妙門。求菩薩道。要先持此",
      "end": "無想相。無想羯南。流轉國土。如土梟等。附塊為兒。及破鏡鳥。以毒樹果。抱為其子。子成父母。皆遭其食。其類充塞。是名眾生。十二種類。"
    },
    {
      "volume": 8,
      "url": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%A5%9E%E5%9A%B4%E7%B6%93/%E5%8D%B708",
      "permalink": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=%E6%A5%9E%E5%9A%B4%E7%B6%93/%E5%8D%B708&oldid=1880781",
      "sourceSha256": "fa9f1cfb58a8b8a85769708ea8322d1da8220b6a099187eec7f6110ab097fdc6",
      "textSha256": "68c5432ea07608e45efdc191cf9a8b0bc89134f03f5576b5fd62a2b7627fa95b",
      "paragraphs": 119,
      "charactersWithPunctuation": 7693,
      "start": "阿難。如是眾生。一一類中。亦各各具。十二顛倒。猶如捏目。亂華發生",
      "end": "於行事交，了然超越。命終之後，遍能出超化無化境。如是一類，名他化自在天。阿難。如是六天，形雖出動，心跡尚交。自此已還，名為欲界。"
    },
    {
      "volume": 9,
      "url": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%A5%9E%E5%9A%B4%E7%B6%93/%E5%8D%B709",
      "permalink": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=%E6%A5%9E%E5%9A%B4%E7%B6%93/%E5%8D%B709&oldid=1316382",
      "sourceSha256": "e569c68cb13ff1aa54fff5864c3bf709caf7a2a1738155a847e2cbc8dd437490",
      "textSha256": "92e4e397310d005b312507c5c97fe43023ec477b915653e9fe0204031c45faf6",
      "paragraphs": 175,
      "charactersWithPunctuation": 9440,
      "start": "阿難。世間一切。所修心人。不假禪那。無有智慧。但能執身。不行淫欲",
      "end": "言登聖。大妄語成。墮無間獄。汝等必須。將如來語。於我滅後。傳示末法。遍令眾生。開悟斯義。無令天魔。得其方便。保持覆護。成無上道。"
    },
    {
      "volume": 10,
      "url": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%A5%9E%E5%9A%B4%E7%B6%93/%E5%8D%B710",
      "permalink": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=%E6%A5%9E%E5%9A%B4%E7%B6%93/%E5%8D%B710&oldid=163294",
      "sourceSha256": "41fad997d1f1a4096dca475713d0b9e13c50415e780342223b2d5dbdb745c145",
      "textSha256": "a41385964a7b0e0cdc781fd0b5cc4b00774e5e0fa73358ba78fb09c651a17632",
      "paragraphs": 106,
      "charactersWithPunctuation": 6617,
      "start": "阿難。彼善男子。修三摩提。想陰盡者。是人平常。夢想銷滅。寤寐恒一",
      "end": "經已。比丘。比丘尼。優婆塞。優婆夷。一切世間。天人阿修羅。及諸他方。菩薩二乘。聖仙童子。並初發心。大力鬼神。皆大歡喜。作禮而去。"
    }
  ]
}
